    # Compute E using i-k-j loop order.
    # This gives:
    #   - Row-major, contiguous accesses to B[k, j] and E[i, j] along j.
    #   - Reuse of A[i, k] across the inner j-loop via the scalar a_ik.
    for i in seq(0, ni):
